  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Terminus</b> is the 9th Planet from the sun and the farthest known planet in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sol_system\" title=\"Sol system\">solar system</a>. The planet is named after <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terminus_(god)\">Terminus, the roman god of borders.</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Moons\">Moons</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTerminus%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Terminus is a Super Earth, 10.14 times more massive than Earth, and 2.77 times the size. It has 11 satellites, most of which are in highly elliptical orbits and believed to be captured Kuiper Belt Objects. Its two largest moons, Sabine and Titus, have diameters of 905 km and 1311 km respectively. Due to the extreme distance from the Sun, and relatively limited economic value, Terminus only has a population of a few thousand researchers and engineers. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Titus\">Titus</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTerminus%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Titus is the second largest moon of Terminus and its largest population center. Titus is cryosphere comparable to Europa, Ganymede, Callisto, or Enceladus with a small subsurface ocean. While most residents of Terminus live on its <a href=\"/wiki/Orbitals\" title=\"Orbitals\">Orbitals</a>, the presence of liquid water in the subsurface ocean of Titus makes it the most important center for economic activity.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sabine\">Sabine</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTerminus%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Sabine is the largest and most massive moon of Terminus. Sabine is slated to be deorbited down system to <a href=\"/wiki/Venus\" title=\"Venus\">Venus</a> to serve as its new moon, via one of the most ambitious <a href=\"/wiki/Gravitonics\" title=\"Gravitonics\">gravity propulsion projects ever attempted.</a> There is an ongoing debate to rename Sabine \"Cupid\" in honor of its future position.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119081819\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.008 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 11/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:3672-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119081819 and revision id 11151. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
